{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Samsen879/ciecopilot-home/pulls/1659","id":4103735484,"node_id":"PR_kwDOO5D6p870mgi8","html_url":"https://github.com/Samsen879/ciecopilot-home/pull/1659","diff_url":"https://github.com/Samsen879/ciecopilot-home/pull/1659.diff","patch_url":"https://github.com/Samsen879/ciecopilot-home/pull/1659.patch","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Samsen879/ciecopilot-home/issues/1659","number":1659,"state":"closed","locked":false,"title":"[codex] Generalize official MS question-header detection","user":{"login":"Samsen879","id":172257175,"node_id":"U_kgDOCkRvlw","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/172257175?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Samsen879","html_url":"https://github.com/Samsen879","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Samsen879/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Samsen879/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Samsen879/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Samsen879/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Samsen879/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Samsen879/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Samsen879/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Samsen879/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Samsen879/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"body":"Closes #1658\n\n## What changed\n\nThis repair replaces the absolute `x < 65` MS question-digit heuristic with a source-grounded locator that:\n\n- normalizes PDF words into rendered page coordinates, including the rotated 2017 layouts;\n- binds explicit layouts to the official `Question` / `Answer` / `Marks` table topology;\n- resolves older borderless layouts only when one complete ordered question column is uniquely supported by mark-code rows;\n- rejects missing, reordered, duplicate-root, competing/formula, and invalid-region candidates fail closed;\n- builds bounded MS region chains in the same normalized coordinate space and caches per-paper headers during packet preparation.\n\nThe user-visible effect is that genuine 2017 question rows are no longer rejected before checker dispatch, while formula digits, furniture, totals, gaps, and ambiguous sequences remain ineligible.\n\n## Evidence and preservation\n\nThe checked-in canonical receipt at `artifacts/method-map/v1-9709/ms-question-header-repair-1658/cross-batch-regression.v1.json` records:\n\n- exact base/origin main: `64d64aa31174c97b56cfdf543fa286c59ecf28f5`;\n- 54/54 official papers and 442/442 questions with one ordered header and a non-empty bounded MS region chain;\n- Batch 001: 27 papers / 227 questions, with exact frozen header and region-box zero drift;\n- Batch 002: 27 papers / 215 questions, including all 12 legacy 2017 failures repaired;\n- preserved partial-v2 file/hash custody and exact compatibility for 113 packets, 113 evidence manifests, and 151 frozen inputs;\n- fresh isolated v2, v3, v4, and active v5 packet/bundle validators passing for all 215 questions with complete QP/MS evidence, candidate blindness, exact hashes, and disjoint three-shard ownership;\n- zero provider calls, zero candidate-response reads, and zero semantic/canonical/production/public writes.\n\nReceipt canonical SHA-256: `4faf6a0b1bcedf5ff75744a10b2957f4400ac53577fc80f7a3d8a21628772b1f`.\n\n## Verification\n\n- `PYTHONPATH=. .venv/bin/python scripts/vlm/__tests__/issue_1658_ms_question_headers.test.py` — 5 tests passed (cross-batch census, frozen zero drift, canonical receipt, malformed/ambiguous fixtures).\n- `PYTHONPATH=. .venv/bin/python scripts/vlm/__tests__/issue_1653_structural_batch_001.test.py` — 8 tests passed.\n- `PYTHONPATH=. .venv/bin/python scripts/vlm/__tests__/issue_1656_authoritative_continuation.test.py` — 9 tests passed.\n- Full isolated receipt generation and v2→v5 validation — PASS, 54 papers / 442 questions and 215 complete Batch 002 packets/bundles.\n- `python3 -m py_compile ...` — PASS.\n- `git diff --check` — PASS.\n- `npm run workflow:codex-preflight -- --json` — safe task branch; report/artifact guard and A+ ratchet healthy (expected dirty/no-upstream warnings before commit/push only).\n\nIndependent exact-head review is required before merge. Do not merge or resume #1655 until this PR merges and exact-main readback passes.\n","created_at":"2026-07-21T22:49:37Z","updated_at":"2026-07-21T23:06:55Z","closed_at":"2026-07-21T22:58:47Z","merged_at":"2026-07-21T22:58:47Z","merge_commit_sha":"7bbff32acb1b4507a44427be06a9aef9db54920a","assignees":[],"requested_reviewers":[],"requested_teams":[],"labels":[],"milestone":null,"draft":false,"commits_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Samsen879/ciecopilot-home/pulls/1659/commits","review_comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Samsen879/ciecopilot-home/pulls/1659/comments","review_comment_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Samsen879/ciecopilot-home/pulls/comments{/number}","comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Samsen879/ciecopilot-home/issues/1659/comments","statuses_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Samsen879/ciecopilot-home/statuses/f584899f76f4e08f22b286249416467a5775e1c0","head":{"label":"Samsen879:task/1658-generalize-official-ms-question-header-detection","ref":"task/1658-generalize-official-ms-question-header-detection","sha":"f584899f76f4e08f22b286249416467a5775e1c0","user":{"login":"Samsen879","id":172257175,"node_id":"U_kgDOCkRvlw","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/172257175?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Samsen879","html_url":"https://github.com/Samsen879","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Samsen879/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Samsen879/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Samsen879/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Samsen879/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subs